{"body":"# IBM Db2 TechX Summit 2026 — Project Submission\n\n## 1. Project Overview\n\n- **Project Title:** Cinematic Chess 3D – IBM Db2 AI Chess Analytics\n- **Project Slug:** `submissions/cinematic-chess-db2-analytics/`\n- **Short Description:** Existing cinematic 3D chess extended with a Python FastAPI/ibm_db backend for saved games, results and opening analytics, plus optional LangChain coaching.\n- **Problem Solved & Target Audience:** Persistent match review and statistics for chess learners.\n\n## 2. Team Information\n\n- **Team Name:** Cinematic Chess AI (individual submission)\n\n| Full Name | GitHub Username | Email / Role |\n|---|---|---|\n| Jay K. Gadage | @srjay999-giT | Individual developer; email intentionally omitted |\n\n## 3. IBM Db2 Integration Summary\n\n- **Environment:** Hosted IBM Db2, intended target; live connection and testing pending.\n- **Use:** PGN CLOB storage, moves, evaluations, game results and opening statistics.\n- **Connector:** `ibm_db`, bound SQL parameters, atomic transactions, rollback and UUID idempotency.\n- **Schema:** CHESS_GAMES, CHESS_MOVES, CHESS_GAME_ANALYSIS, CHESS_OPENING_STATISTICS.\n- **Verification:** Follow the submission README to configure a real database, initialize tables, run live tests and `npm run demo:api`. These live checks have not passed yet; no successful live persistence is claimed.\n\n## 4. Technology Stack & AI / LLM Usage\n\n- **Languages:** TypeScript, Python, SQL.\n- **Frameworks:** React, Vite, Three.js, React Three Fiber, GSAP, FastAPI.\n- **AI:** Stockfish 18 browser evaluation; existing heuristic gameplay opponent preserved.\n- **Optional LLM:** LangChain with configurable Ollama/OpenAI, disabled by default and not live-tested. Coaching uses retrieved Db2 game statistics.\n\n## 5. Demonstration & Links\n\n- **Live Demo:** https://cinematic-chess-game3d.vercel.app/ — original gameplay only, not the Db2 upgrade.\n- **Demo Video:** Not available.\n- **External Source:** https://github.com/srjay999-giT/cinematic-chess-game3D\n- Complete upgraded source is included in this submission.\n\n## 6. Submission Verification Checklist\n\n- [x] Folder Structure: single submission directory copied from the official template.\n- [x] Naming Conventions: matching slug, branch and PR title.\n- [x] Complete Documentation: README and architecture completed.\n- [x] Metadata File: completed valid JSON; public email/video empty.\n- [x] No Secrets or Credentials: forbidden-file and secret-pattern scans passed; examples contain placeholders.\n- [ ] Tested Setup Instructions: source workspace local checks passed; fresh-install and live Db2 verification pending.\n- [x] License Declared: original distribution terms and Stockfish GPLv3 notice included.\n- [ ] Code of Conduct: participant acknowledgment remains with the submitter.\n- [x] Scope Isolation: only the new submission directory is changed.\n- [ ] Google Form Submission: the submitter will handle the form separately; it has not been submitted by this assistant.\n\n## 7. Additional Notes for Reviewers & Judges\n\nOfficial submission validator passed. Local source checks: 9 frontend tests passed; 19 backend tests passed and 2 live Db2 tests skipped; production build passed; browser gameplay smoke passed. After the Stockfish loading fix, Chromium evaluated nine positions at depth 10 without browser errors. The final worker fix was directly browser-tested; a fresh packaged-install run remains pending.\n\nLive Db2 credentials are not configured. Real SQL/CLOB round trips, saves, rollback, idempotency, persisted history and analytics need live verification. The application is a single-user demo without authentication. Optional coaching and updated deployment are pending. This disclosure is intentional; structural validation is not presented as proof of live Db2 correctness.\n","comments":[],"files":[{"path":"submissions/cinematic-chess-db2-analytics/.env.example","additions":33,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"submiss